 "remarks": "Tucked into a picturesque 1.28-acre setting in West Norwalk, this spacious 2,912 sqft split-level ranch offers versatility, natural beauty and endless potential. The home features a large kitchen with center island, dining area and direct access to a deck overlooking the backyard. A formal dining room flows seemlessly into the living room where a fireplace and oversized skylight create a bright, light-filled space ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The home offers 3 bedrooms and 2.5 baths. The third bedroom includes its own bath and sitting area, offering excellent potential for an in-law setup, guest accommodations, or private home office space. The lower level expands the living space with a family room featuring a fireplace, adding even more room to gather. The outdoor setting is what truly makes this property special. A large fenced backyard provides ample space for entertaining, recreation, pets, or gardening, while the scenic stream, tranquil pond, and charming wooden bridges create a storybook backdrop unlike anything else. A whole-house generator adds additional convenience and peace of mind. Rich with character and opportunity, this estate property is being sold \"As is\" and is ready for its next chapter. No probate delay expected.",
